  </TR>
<TR STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: left">
  <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Management&rsquo;s Discussion and Analysis</B></FONT></TD>
