<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Management&rsquo;s Discussion and Analysis
(&ldquo;<B>MD&amp;A</B>&rdquo;) is intended to help the reader understand Titan Mining Corporation (&ldquo;<B>Titan</B>&rdquo;, &ldquo;<B>we</B>&rdquo;,
&ldquo;<B>our</B>&rdquo; or the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;), our operations, financial performance, and current and future business
environment for the three and nine months ended September 30, 2025, and includes events up to the date of this MD&amp;A. This discussion
should be read in conjunction with the Company&rsquo;s unaudited condensed consolidated interim financial statements for the three and
nine months ended September 30, 2025 and 2024 (the &ldquo;<B>Interim Financial Statements</B>&rdquo;) and the related notes thereto and
other corporate filings, including the Company&rsquo;s annual audited consolidated financial statements for the years ended December 31,
2024 and 2023 (the &ldquo;<B>Annual Financial Statements</B>&rdquo;). Unless otherwise specified, all financial information has been derived
from the Company&rsquo;s Interim Financial Statements which have been prepared in accordance with IFRS Accounting Standards as issued
by the International Accounting Standards Board (&ldquo;<B>IFRS</B>&rdquo;) applicable to the preparation of interim financial statements
including International Accounting Standards 34 &ndash; Interim Financial Reporting (&ldquo;<B>IAS 34</B>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Additional information regarding Titan, including
the risks related to our business and those that are reasonably likely to affect our financial statements in the future, is contained
in our continuous disclosure materials, including our most recent Annual Information Form (&ldquo;<B>AIF</B>&rdquo;) and Management Information
Circular, which are available on the Company&rsquo;s website at www.titanminingcorp.com and under the Company&rsquo;s profile on SEDAR+
at www.sedarplus.com.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This MD&amp;A is dated November 4, 2025. All dollar
amounts reported herein are in US dollars unless otherwise indicated.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>


