<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#9679;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Identified Germanium in existing zinc-processing circuit &ndash; no new mining required.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 18pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

